# purpose: every TRANSFER rejection, in precedence order, each proven against the one below it.
# exercises: same-account before lookup; unknown source before unknown destination; closed before
#            frozen, source before destination; frozen before non-positive; non-positive before
#            currency-mismatch; mismatch before insufficient; frozen in EITHER direction is refused.

OPEN src USD
OPEN dst USD
OPEN eur EUR
OPEN gone USD
OPEN ice USD
DEPOSIT src 100
DEPOSIT dst 100
DEPOSIT eur 100
DEPOSIT ice 100
CLOSE gone
FREEZE ice

# 1. same-account: even when the account does not exist, or is closed
TRANSFER nobody nobody 5
TRANSFER gone gone 5
TRANSFER src src 5

# 2/3. unknown source before unknown destination
TRANSFER nobody nobody2 5
TRANSFER nobody src 5
TRANSFER src nobody 5

# 4/5. closed source before closed destination; closed before frozen
TRANSFER gone ice 5
TRANSFER ice gone 5
TRANSFER gone dst 5
TRANSFER src gone 5

# 6/7. frozen source before frozen destination; frozen before non-positive
TRANSFER ice src -5
TRANSFER src ice -5
TRANSFER ice src 5
TRANSFER src ice 5

# 8. non-positive before currency-mismatch and before insufficient
TRANSFER src eur -5
TRANSFER src eur 0
TRANSFER src dst -500

# 9. currency-mismatch before insufficient
TRANSFER src eur 500
TRANSFER src eur 5
TRANSFER eur src 5

# 10. insufficient-funds names the source
TRANSFER src dst 100.01
TRANSFER dst src 100.01

# and now some succeed; tags count only successes
TRANSFER src dst 100
TRANSFER src dst 0.01
TRANSFER dst src 200
TRANSFER dst src 0.01
UNFREEZE ice
TRANSFER ice src 100
TRANSFER eur eur 1
BALANCE src
BALANCE dst
BALANCE ice
BALANCE eur
